ite\" href=\"/mesta\">Места</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-px h-4 bg-white/20\"></span><a title=\"Графики с източник за всичко\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/statistiki\">Статистики</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Заплата, кредит, лична инфлация\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/kalkulatori\">Калкулатори</a></span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-x-5\"><a title=\"Какво е ново в данните\" class=\"no-underline pb-1 border-b-2 text-white/75 border-transparent hover:text-white\" href=\"/novini\">Новини</a></span></nav><div class=\"ml-auto flex items-center gap-1\"><a aria-label=\"Търсене\" class=\"no-underline text-white hover:text-white p-2 rounded hover:bg-white/10\" href=\"/tarsene\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"10.5\" cy=\"10.5\" r=\"6.5\"></circle><path d=\"m20 20-4.8-4.8\"></path></svg></a><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"mobile-menu\" class=\"lg:hidden flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-2 rounded bg-white/10 text-[15px] font-semibold\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"relative w-4 h-3\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-0\"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-1.5 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white \"></span><span class=\"absolute left-0 w-4 h-0.5 bg-white transition top-3\"></span></span>Меню</button></div></div></header><!--/$--><main class=\"flex-1 min-h-[100svh]\"><div class=\"mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12 max-w-[88rem]\"><div class=\"relative left-1/2 right-1/2 -ml-[50vw] -mr-[50vw] w-screen bg-surface -mt-8 sm:-mt-12 mb-10\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[88rem] px-4 sm:px-6 py-8 sm:py-12\"><p class=\"text-sm mb-4\"><a href=\"/parlament/partii\">← <!-- -->Всички групи</a></p><h1 class=\"display text-5xl sm:text-7xl max-w-4xl\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full text-white font-bold shrink-0\" style=\"width:64px;height:64px;background:#2f6f8f;font-size:24.32px\">ПБ</span>Прогресивна България</span></h1><div class=\"mt-3 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl\">Коалиция около Румен Радев, създадена за изборите на 19 април 2026 г. Спечели мнозинство и от 8 май 2026 г. управлява сама.</div></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Депутати сега</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">143</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\"><a href=\"/parlament/partii\">списък и поведение</a></p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Гласове на листата (19.04.2026)</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">1 444 920</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">44,59% · 1-во място</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Годишна субсидия на листата</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">4,33 млн. €</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">по 3 € на глас</p></div><div class=\"bg-surface rounded-sm p-4\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Единство при гласуване</p><p class=\"display text-[2.4rem] leading-none mt-1\">97%</p><p class=\"text-xs text-muted mt-1\">колко от групата гласува еднакво средно</p></div></div><nav aria-label=\"Секции на страницата\" class=\"sticky top-14 lg:top-0 z-30 -mx-4 sm:-mx-6 px-4 sm:px-6 py-2 mb-8 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur border-b border-rule\"><ul class=\"flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto text-[15px] whitespace-nowrap\"><li><a href=\"#izbirateli\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Избиратели</a></li><li><a href=\"#profil\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Кой гласува за тях</a></li><li><a href=\"#zakoni\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Закони</a></li><li><a href=\"#temi\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">По теми</a></li><li><a href=\"#saiuznici\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">С кого гласува</a></li><li><a href=\"#signali\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Дела и санкции</a></li><li><a href=\"#subsidiya\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Субсидия</a></li><li><a href=\"#deputati\" class=\"block px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-surface no-underline text-ink hover:ring-1 hover:ring-green\">Депутати</a></li></ul></nav><section id=\"izbirateli\" class=\"mb-14 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Къде са избирателите</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-4 max-w-3xl\">Делът на листата от гласовете за партии във всяка община. Посочи община, за да видиш числата.</p><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><div class=\"w-full min-h-[200px]\"><p class=\"text-sm text-muted\">Зареждане на картата…</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 mt-6\"><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-силни общини</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Самуил</span><span class=\"num\">73,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->2402</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Кричим</span><span class=\"num\">68,8<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1877</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Златоград</span><span class=\"num\">64,2<!-- -->% · <!-- -->3144</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Съединение</span><span class=\"num\">64<!-- -->% · <!-- -->2559</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Перущица</span><span class=\"num\">62,9<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1165</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Белене</span><span class=\"num\">62,8<!-- -->% · <!-- -->2249</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Искър</span><span class=\"num\">61,9<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1302</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Борово</span><span class=\"num\">61,4<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1127</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Златарица</span><span class=\"num\">61,1<!-- -->% · <!-- -->1139</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Лясковец</span><span class=\"num\">60,3<!-- -->% · <!-- -->3111</span></li></ol></div><div><p class=\"font-semibold mb-2\">Най-слаби общини</p><ol class=\"text-[15px] space-y-1\"><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Джебел</span><span class=\"num\">7,1<!-- -->% · <!-- -->483</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Белица</span><span class=\"num\">10,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->560</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Хитрино</span><span class=\"num\">11,6<!-- -->% · <!-- -->373</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Върбица</span><span class=\"num\">13,2<!-- -->% · <!-- -->570</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Венец</span><span class=\"num\">13,3<!-- -->% · <!-- -->438</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Черноочене</span><span class=\"num\">14,6<!-- -->% · <!-- -->696</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Якоруда</span><span class=\"num\">16,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->896</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Маджарово</span><span class=\"num\">16,5<!-- -->% · <!-- -->209</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Каолиново</span><span class=\"num\">17,1<!-- -->% · <!-- -->927</span></li><li class=\"flex justify-between border-b border-rule py-1\"><span>Сърница</span><span class=\"num\">17,9<!-- -->% · <!-- -->477</span></li></ol></div></div><details class=\"mt-6\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer font-semibold text-green\">По избирателни райони (<!-- -->32<!-- -->)</summary><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white mt-3\"><div class=\"w-full\"></div></div></details></section><section id=\"profil\" class=\"mb-14 scroll-mt-32 lg:scroll-mt-20\"><div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-4 mb-5\"><h2 class=\"display text-[2rem] sm:text-[2.4rem]\">Кой гласува за тях</h2></div><p class=\"text-[15px] text-muted -mt-3 mb-5 max-w-3xl\">Каква част от избирателите на листата е във всяка група, сравнено с всички гласували. <!-- -->Екзит полът е извадково проучване пред секциите, не преброяване. Публикацията не посочва размера на извадката и грешката, затова разлики от няколко пункта не са надеждни.</p><div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"ring-1 ring-rule rounded-sm p-4 bg-white\"><p class=\"font-semibold mb-3\">Пол</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-sm\"><div class=\"flex justify-between\"><span>Мъже</span><span class=\"num\"><b>44,8<!-- -->%</b> <span class=\"text-muted\">/ всички <!-- -->47<!-- -->%</span></span></div><div class=\"h-2 rounded-full bg-surface mt-1 relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width:81.15942028985506%;background:#2f6f8f\"></div><div class=\"absolute top-0 h-full w-0.5 bg-ink\" style=\"left:85.1449275362318